Apple partner Foxconn has started trial production on the <a href="https://www.macrumors.com/roundup/iphone-fold/">iPhone Fold</a>, according to Chinese leaker <a href="https://www.weibo.com/5143897135/QzyNlkRbJ">Instant Digital</a>. Trial production comes before mass production, which Apple plans to start in July as long as no issues come up during the earlier testing stage.<br/>
<br/>
